{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to learn Blender but don't know where to start?      START HERE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Skills Start Here (formerly known as Blender Start Here) teaches the BASICS of Blender through play and storytelling while familiarizing complicated Blender actions with fun mini games and puzzles. LEARN TIPS AND TRICKS from Suzanne while fighting DUBE to free your friends!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Skills Start Here covers 7 topics: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbit, Pan, Zoom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View Selected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, Rotate, Scale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delete, Add Objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera Render</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Object vs Edit Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertices, Edges, Faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've also partnered with some of the BEST Blender Mentors and Creators to feature in our COLLECTABLE CREATOR CARDS found throughout the game. These cards will feature their work to help YOU decide where to continue your Blender journey after the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OUR GOAL is to help make learning Blender easier FOR EVERYONE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*IMPORTANT NOTE: This game is made for Blender newbies! As in, people who are just starting out in learning Blender. If you already know how to use Blender, this game will probably NOT be of much use to you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836300?t=1753334443","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836300?t=1753334443","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836300/d294e1a99a912e616da81fca86bee1e88ce80529/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753334443","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836300/d294e1a99a912e616da81fca86bee1e88ce80529/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753334443","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2837260,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to learn Blender but don't know where to start?      START HERE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Skills Start Here (formerly known as Blender Start Here) teaches the BASICS of Blender through play and storytelling while familiarizing complicated Blender actions with fun mini games and puzzles. LEARN TIPS AND TRICKS from Suzanne while fighting DUBE to free your friends!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D Skills Start Here covers 7 topics: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orbit, Pan, Zoom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">View Selected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, Rotate, Scale</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delete, Add Objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera Render</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Object vs Edit Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertices, Edges, Faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've also partnered with some of the BEST Blender Mentors and Creators to feature in our COLLECTABLE CREATOR CARDS found throughout the game. These cards will feature their work to help YOU decide where to continue your Blender journey after the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">OUR GOAL is to help make learning Blender easier FOR EVERYONE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*IMPORTANT NOTE: This game is made for Blender newbies! As in, people who are just starting out in learning Blender. If you already know how to use Blender, this game will probably NOT be of much use to you!</p>","developers":["Dave Mills"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_imag